Script
Nowadays, scams, phishing links, and fake messages have become so common that it is difficult for normal users to identify what is real and what is fake.

“Imagine… aapke phone pe ek message aata hai —
‘URGENT! Your bank account has been blocked. Click now to verify.’

Aaj kal scams, phishing links aur fake messages itne common ho gaye hain ki normal users ke liye real aur fake identify karna difficult ho gaya hai.

So we built AGEIX — an AI Powered Scam and Fake Content Detector.”

[Homepage open karo]

“AGEIX is a full-stack AI web application that helps users instantly detect suspicious messages using machine learning and real-time analysis.”

[Fake message paste karo]

“Abhi hum ek scam-like message test karte hain.”

Click “Check Now”

“As you can see, AGEIX successfully detects the message as Fake, shows confidence score, AI reasoning, and also suggests safety actions for the user.”

[Real message paste karo]

“Now let’s test a normal real message.”

Click “Check Now”

“Here, the system correctly identifies the message as Real and provides safe suggestions accordingly.”

[Architecture screen / PPT dikhao]

“Technically, AGEIX uses:

* React and TypeScript for frontend,
* Node.js and Express for backend,
* a separate Flask AI microservice for spam detection,
* and Supabase cloud database for storing scan logs.”

“Both backend and AI services are deployed on Render, while frontend is deployed on Vercel.”

[Deployment links dikhao]

“This is our live deployed frontend, backend API, and AI service.”

[Powerful conclusion]

“AGEIX is not just a college project —
it is an attempt to build a practical AI solution for digital safety.

In a world full of scams and misinformation, our goal is simple:
help users think once before they trust a message online.

Thank you.”
